    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Pixel Merge Balls is a fast-paced arcade game where your mission is simple: move, match, and merge colorful balls before time runs out. Easy to pick up, hard to master \u2014 and even harder to stop playing!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\t\u2022\tQuick and snappy gameplay \u2013 perfect for coffee breaks or score-chasing marathons.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\t\u2022\tRetro pixel art style with an upbeat soundtrack that sticks in your head.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\t\u2022\tIncreasing challenge \u2013 the longer you play, the more intense it gets.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\t\u2022\tEndless scoring potential \u2013 how long can you keep merging before it all falls apart?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love casual games with a retro twist, Super Pixel Merge Balls delivers instant fun with arcade spirit. Simple to learn, hard to put down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901080/extras/bb2e217293fc042e065978f0bd2b2667.poster.avif?t=1748263529\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901080/extras/bb2e217293fc042e065978f0bd2b2667.apng?t=1748263529\" class=\"bb_img\" width=128 height=128 /></picture></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Pixel Merge Balls is a fast-paced arcade game where your mission is simple: move, match, and merge colorful balls before time runs out. Easy to pick up, hard to master \u2014 and even harder to stop playing!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\t\u2022\tQuick and snappy gameplay \u2013 perfect for coffee breaks or score-chasing marathons.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\t\u2022\tRetro pixel art style with an upbeat soundtrack that sticks in your head.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\t\u2022\tIncreasing challenge \u2013 the longer you play, the more intense it gets.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\t\u2022\tEndless scoring potential \u2013 how long can you keep merging before it all falls apart?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love casual games with a retro twist, Super Pixel Merge Balls delivers instant fun with arcade spirit. Simple to learn, hard to put down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901080/extras/bb2e217293fc042e065978f0bd2b2667.poster.avif?t=1748263529\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901080/extras/bb2e217293fc042e065978f0bd2b2667.apng?t=1748263529\" class=\"bb_img\" width=128 height=128 /></picture></span></p>",
